  // {"en":"Periodic probe of container service readiness. ListDeploymentContainer will be removed from service endpoints if the probe fails. Cannot be updated", "zh_CN":"定期探测容器服务就绪情况。如果探针失败，容器将被从服务端点中删除。无法更新"}
