  // {"en":" indicates which kind of seccomp profile will be applied. Valid options are:Localhost - a profile defined in a file on the node should be used. RuntimeDefault - the container runtime default profile should be used. Unconfined - no profile should be applied.", "zh_CN":"指示应用哪种 seccomp 配置文件。有效的选项有：Localhost - 应使用在节点上的文件中定义的配置文件。RuntimeDefault - 应使用容器运行时的默认配置文件。Unconfined - 不应用任何配置文件。"}
