  // {"en":"where the GMSA admission webhook inlines the contents of the GMSA credential spec named by the GMSACredentialSpecName field", "zh_CN":"GMSA 准入 Webhook 内嵌由 gmsaCredentialSpecName 字段所指定的 GMSA 凭证规约的内容的地方"}
